人數",null,"0ahUKEwi546O0steWAxV9kK8BHaVbLVEQ3IcHCOoBKCc",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["👉 鷹流東京醬油拉麵-蘭丸(林森南店) 👈\n\n沒在 💫 林森南店 吃過，基本上都是\n往本店跑，熱死了，今天就吃清湯吧：\n💫 東京醬油味玉拉麵 /260 ♠\n很熟悉的基本款加味玉，就這款了，\n少了濃湯的背脂，喝起來比較簡單與\n清爽，醬油的香度有出來，\n自製麵體的口感一樣不差，\n可是選店家麵硬設定不會有粉味吧？？\n旁邊似乎看到有製麵工作區？！？\n叉燒沒太大的感覺，中規中矩的輸出\n，溏心蛋的呈現有達到我喜歡的程度\n，味道也有入到裡面，手上這碗整體\n有平衡感，但是堆疊出來的層次感覺\n略比本店低...有機會再吃吃 林森南店\n的濃湯試試，店內六張桌子，平常日\n中午沒排到，💫 三星評價，謝謝招待\n，祝生意興隆，感恩感謝.\n🌍2025.07",null,[0,41]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB3ZDFKNlNsTlZWMUozWkZWak1rMUZSbGRVYmxKSlpHa3dkRTV0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB3ZDFKNlNsTlZWMUozWkZWak1rMUZSbGRVYmxKSlpHa3dkRTV0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB3ZDFKNlNsTlZWMUozWkZWak1rMUZSbGRVYmxKSlpHa3dkRTV0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB3ZDFKNlNsTlZWMUozWkZWak1rMUZSbGRVYmxKSlpHa3dkRTV0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB3ZDFKNlNsTlZWMUozWkZWak1rMUZSbGRVYmxKSlpHa3dkRTV0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB3ZDFKNlNsTlZWMUozWkZWak1rMUZSbGRVYmxKSlpHa3dkRTV0WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,17110,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20wd1J6SlNVV1J3ZFVjMk1FRldUblJJZGkwdE5tYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xcd08f373c4ca58fe!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm0wRzJSUWRwdUc2MEFWTnRIdi0tNmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQ